    "updated_at": "2018-05-02T14:28:35Z",
    "body": "- **Testing:** Yes, testing is a pain today, and the blame goes to #1903 again.  I have added a wpt in my Chromium [CL](https://crrev.com/c/1039265), ptal.\r\n  - I am using `navigator.vibrate` to test activation because currently only Chrome and Firefox are expected to pass the test, and both of them support `navigator.vibrate`.\r\n  - I originally hoped to use `window.open` instead because all browsers support it.  However, diffs in popup blocker behavior turned out to be tricky.\r\n  - I also tried [Element.requestFullscreen()](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fullscreen_API) but didn't want to add prefix-specific switches.\r\n\r\n- **Event ordering:** Done.\r\n\r\n- **Acknowledgements:** Done.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
